        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: King Hans, John, King of Denmark\n- Places: Copenhagen, Denmark, Norway, Sweden, Scandinavia\n- Organizations: Royal Mint (Denmark), Kalmar Union\n- Topics: coin production, monarchy\n\nFacts:\n- John, King of Denmark, was born as Johannes on 2 February 1455 and died on 20 February 1513.\n- John, King of Denmark, was known as Hans in Danish and Norwegian and as Johan in Swedish.\n- John, King of Denmark, was a Scandinavian monarch under the Kalmar Union.\n- King Hans was the first king to start producing coins in Copenhagen.",
